# No API base URL is needed: the app always calls relative "/api/..." paths.
# - In dev, Vite's server proxy (vite.config.js) forwards /api to the local backend.
# - In prod, the backend serves this app's build output from the same origin.
#
# Add any future frontend env vars below, prefixed with VITE_ so Vite exposes them
# (see https://vite.dev/guide/env-and-mode.html).
